{
  "name": "Chronic Pain Europe",
  "remarks": [
    "European calibration of chronic pain as a coded diagnosis.",
    "NEW in R4. No module anywhere in the tree emitted 82423001. R2 modelled it at",
    "2.728%; R3 dropped it, and the 'chronic pain group' proxy (joint pain, muscle",
    "pain, fibromyalgia) reached only 5.88% against a 19.0% European reference.",
    "",
    "That proxy was itself inflated: ~2,200 of the 2,878 patients carrying",
    "57676002 Joint pain were mis-filed knee osteoarthritis (see the codes[0] bug",
    "fixed in osteoarthritis_europe.json). Correcting that bug makes the group",
    "worse, which is what this module is for.",
    "",
    "Calibrated against: Breivik et al. 2006 European Pain Survey (19% of adults",
    "with chronic pain of moderate-severe intensity lasting > 6 months),",
    "Pain Alliance Europe 2022, GBD 2019 Europe.",
    "",
    "Design: chronic pain is largely secondary, so the hazard is tiered on the",
    "conditions that drive it, read by Active Condition rather than by attribute.",
    "Episodes resolve at 5% per year, giving a steady state rather than unbounded",
    "accumulation in older cohorts. The attribute is set false on resolution so a",
    "patient can develop chronic pain again later.",
    "",
    "NOTE: the 19% target is a steady-state estimate from incidence and resolution",
    "rates, not a simulation result. It needs a verification run.",
    "R4 round 3: resolution rate halved."
  ],
  "states": {
    "Initial": {
      "type": "Initial",
      "direct_transition": "Age_Guard"
    },
    "Age_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Age",
        "operator": ">=",
        "quantity": 18,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Naive_Guard"
    },
    "Naive_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "remarks": [
        "Allows re-onset after a resolved episode: the attribute is set false,",
        "not left set, when Chronic_Pain_Resolves fires."
      ],
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Or",
        "conditions": [
          {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "chronic_pain",
            "operator": "is nil"
          },
          {
            "condition_type": "Attribute",
            "attribute": "chronic_pain",
            "operator": "==",
            "value": false
          }
        ]
      },
      "direct_transition": "Annual_Delay"
    },
    "Annual_Delay": {
      "type": "Delay",
      "exact": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Risk_Check"
    },
    "Risk_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "Chronic pain is largely secondary. The high tier reads the conditions that",
        "drive it in European surveys - osteoarthritis, chronic low back pain,",
        "rheumatoid arthritis, fibromyalgia, diabetic neuropathy, cancer - by Active",
        "Condition rather than by attribute, so it does not depend on other modules",
        "exposing one."
      ],
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Or",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "condition_type": "Active Condition",
                "codes": [
                  {
                    "system": "SNOMED-CT",
                    "code": "239873007",
                    "display": "Osteoarthritis of knee (disorder)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Active Condition",
                "codes": [
                  {
                    "system": "SNOMED-CT",
                    "code": "239872002",
                    "display": "Osteoarthritis of hip (disorder)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Active Condition",
                "codes": [
                  {
                    "system": "SNOMED-CT",
                    "code": "201834006",
                    "display": "Localized  primary osteoarthritis of the hand (disorder)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Active Condition",
                "codes": [
                  {
                    "system": "SNOMED-CT",
                    "code": "278860009",
                    "display": "Chronic low back pain (disorder)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Active Condition",
                "codes": [
                  {
                    "system": "SNOMED-CT",
                    "code": "69896004",
                    "display": "Rheumatoid arthritis (disorder)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Active Condition",
                "codes": [
                  {
                    "system": "SNOMED-CT",
                    "code": "95417003",
                    "display": "Primary fibromyalgia syndrome (disorder)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Active Condition",
                "codes": [
                  {
                    "system": "SNOMED-CT",
                    "code": "230572002",
                    "display": "Diabetic neuropathy (disorder)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Attribute",
                "attribute": "other_cancer",
                "operator": "is not nil"
              }
            ]
          },
          "transition": "High_Age_Check"
        },
        {
          "transition": "Low_Age_Check"
        }
      ]
    },
    "High_Age_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 45,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "Prob_High_18_44"
        },
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 65,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "Prob_High_45_64"
        },
        {
          "transition": "Prob_High_65_plus"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Low_Age_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "conditional_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 45,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "Prob_Low_18_44"
        },
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "Age",
            "operator": "<",
            "quantity": 65,
            "unit": "years"
          },
          "transition": "Prob_Low_45_64"
        },
        {
          "transition": "Prob_Low_65_plus"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Prob_High_18_44": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "3.50% annual incidence, high tier, age 18-44."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.035,
          "transition": "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.965,
          "transition": "Annual_Delay"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Prob_High_45_64": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "5.00% annual incidence, high tier, age 45-64."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.05,
          "transition": "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.95,
          "transition": "Annual_Delay"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Prob_High_65_plus": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "5.50% annual incidence, high tier, age 65-plus."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.055,
          "transition": "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.945,
          "transition": "Annual_Delay"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Prob_Low_18_44": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "0.35% annual incidence, low tier, age 18-44."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.0035,
          "transition": "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.9965,
          "transition": "Annual_Delay"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Prob_Low_45_64": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "0.60% annual incidence, low tier, age 45-64."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.006,
          "transition": "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.994,
          "transition": "Annual_Delay"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Prob_Low_65_plus": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "0.80% annual incidence, low tier, age 65-plus."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.008,
          "transition": "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.992,
          "transition": "Annual_Delay"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain": {
      "type": "ConditionOnset",
      "target_encounter": "Pain_Encounter",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "82423001",
          "display": "Chronic pain (finding)"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Pain_Encounter",
      "assign_to_attribute": "chronic_pain",
      "remarks": [
        "assign_to_attribute stores the condition entry itself. It must NOT be followed",
        "by SetAttribute chronic_pain = true: that would replace the entry with a",
        "Boolean and every later state using reason: chronic_pain would throw",
        "ClassCastException (Boolean cannot be cast to HealthRecord$Entry).",
        "Clear_Chronic_Pain sets false only after the episode has ended, and the next",
        "onset re-assigns the entry."
      ]
    },
    "Pain_Encounter": {
      "type": "Encounter",
      "encounter_class": "ambulatory",
      "reason": "chronic_pain",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "11429006",
          "display": "Consultation (procedure)"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "Pain_Score"
    },
    "Pain_Score": {
      "type": "Observation",
      "category": "exam",
      "unit": "{score}",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "LOINC",
          "code": "72514-3",
          "display": "Pain severity - 0-10 verbal numeric rating [Score] - Reported"
        }
      ],
      "range": {
        "low": 4,
        "high": 9
      },
      "direct_transition": "Pain_Management_Decision"
    },
    "Pain_Management_Decision": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "EFIC / European chronic pain guidance: non-pharmacological first,",
        "NSAIDs and paracetamol next, weak opioids in a minority."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.3,
          "transition": "Pain_Physiotherapy"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.35,
          "transition": "Pain_Prescribe_NSAID"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.2,
          "transition": "Pain_Prescribe_Paracetamol"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.15,
          "transition": "End_Pain_Encounter"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Pain_Physiotherapy": {
      "type": "Procedure",
      "reason": "chronic_pain",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "722138006",
          "display": "Physical therapy (regime/therapy)"
        }
      ],
      "duration": {
        "low": 30,
        "high": 45,
        "unit": "minutes"
      },
      "direct_transition": "End_Pain_Encounter"
    },
    "Pain_Prescribe_NSAID": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "reason": "chronic_pain",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "310965",
          "display": "Ibuprofen 400 MG Oral Tablet"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "End_Pain_Encounter"
    },
    "Pain_Prescribe_Paracetamol": {
      "type": "MedicationOrder",
      "reason": "chronic_pain",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "RxNorm",
          "code": "198440",
          "display": "Acetaminophen 500 MG Oral Tablet"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "End_Pain_Encounter"
    },
    "End_Pain_Encounter": {
      "type": "EncounterEnd",
      "direct_transition": "Pain_Review_Delay"
    },
    "Pain_Review_Delay": {
      "type": "Delay",
      "range": {
        "low": 10,
        "high": 14,
        "unit": "months"
      },
      "direct_transition": "Pain_Resolution_Check"
    },
    "Pain_Resolution_Check": {
      "type": "Simple",
      "remarks": [
        "R4 verification round 3 (2026-08-29): resolution 5% -> 2.5% per year.",
        "Measured at 9.74% against a 19.0% Breivik reference (-49%). Steady state is",
        "p = i/(i+r), so the blended effective incidence is 0.54%/year; halving r moves",
        "the steady state to ~17.8% without inflating incidence. Chronic pain persists",
        "by definition, so lengthening episodes is the more defensible lever than",
        "generating more of them."
      ],
      "distributed_transition": [
        {
          "distribution": 0.025,
          "transition": "Chronic_Pain_Resolves"
        },
        {
          "distribution": 0.975,
          "transition": "Pain_Review_Encounter"
        }
      ]
    },
    "Pain_Review_Encounter": {
      "type": "Encounter",
      "encounter_class": "ambulatory",
      "reason": "chronic_pain",
      "codes": [
        {
          "system": "SNOMED-CT",
          "code": "390906007",
          "display": "Follow-up encounter (procedure)"
        }
      ],
      "direct_transition": "End_Pain_Review"
    },
    "End_Pain_Review": {
      "type": "EncounterEnd",
      "direct_transition": "Pain_Review_Delay"
    },
    "Chronic_Pain_Resolves": {
      "type": "ConditionEnd",
      "condition_onset": "Diagnose_Chronic_Pain",
      "direct_transition": "Clear_Chronic_Pain"
    },
    "Clear_Chronic_Pain": {
      "type": "SetAttribute",
      "attribute": "chronic_pain",
      "value": false,
      "direct_transition": "Naive_Guard"
    }
  }
}
